# Deny by default; name back what the repository ships.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!pyproject.toml
!requirements.txt
!navigation/
navigation/*
!navigation/*.py
!tests/
tests/*
!tests/*.py
!results/
results/*
!results/*.csv
!results/*.json
!results/*.png
!results/*.md
# One subdirectory per device run: re-open it, deny its contents again,
# name the output types back.
!results/*/
results/*/*
!results/*/*.csv
!results/*/*.json
!results/*/*.png
# CI workflows: re-open .github/ and its workflows/ directory, name the files back.
!.github/
.github/*
!.github/workflows/
.github/workflows/*
!.github/workflows/*.yml
